<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Brickset</title><link>https://brickset.com</link><description>LEGO news from Brickset</description><copyright>Copyright (C) 1997-2026, Brickset ltd.</copyright><generator>Brickset RSS Generator</generator><item><title>21375 Godzilla and Black Friday offers available now!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136611</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136611</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136611_Black Friday.jpg' alt="21375 Godzilla and Black Friday offers available now!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Friday has arrived in the UK and Europe, which means &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21375-1/Godzilla"&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla is now available with its exclusive gift-with-purchase, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40888-1/Godzilla-Logo-Footprint"&gt;40888&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla Logo &amp;amp; Footprint.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In addition, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1/Retro-Jukebox"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox and &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1/Winter-Snow-Globe"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe have returned with the same purchase thresholds as last weekend: &amp;pound;225 / $250 / &amp;euro;250 and &amp;pound;155 / $170 / &amp;euro;170 respectively. However, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21375-1/Godzilla"&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla is excluded from sets that qualify for &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1/Winter-Snow-Globe"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe, which is a shame.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are also a few items of interest available in the Insiders Rewards Centre, including a newly-added Godzilla poster, plus &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/5010880-1/Retro-Space-M-Tron"&gt;5010880&lt;/a&gt; Retro Space M-Tron and &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/5010881-1/Inside-Santa-s-Workshop"&gt;5010881&lt;/a&gt; Inside Santa&amp;#39;s Workshop, which cost 2400 points each.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?u=https://www.lego.com"&gt;Shop now at LEGO.com &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Over 100 sets are discounted, notably including 30% off &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon"&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon and 20% off &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11383-1/Mayor-Manor"&gt;11383&lt;/a&gt; Mayor Manor. You can find a list of highlights after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136611/21375-godzilla-and-black-friday-offers-available-now!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 67009 Arkham Batman Batmobile</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136357</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136357</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136357_Arkham 1.jpg' alt="Review: 67009 Arkham Batman Batmobile"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;LEGO DC Super Heroes features no shortage of Batmobile sets, but there are still many notable models yet to appear. The tank-like vehicle from Batman: Arkham Knight certainly feels overdue, hence the high expectations for &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/67009-1/Arkham-Batman-Batmobile"&gt;67009&lt;/a&gt; Arkham Batman Batmobile.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, this Batmobile is very complex in the video game, switching from a streamlined car to a tank with weaponry and caster wheels. I would not realistically expect a minifigure-scale model to capture those functions, though this vehicle risks looking incomplete without them. On the other hand, the set does offer an unexpected feature not shown in official images.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136357/review-67009-arkham-batman-batmobile"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Creations for Charity livestream event on Saturday</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136587</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136587</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136587_btb.jpg' alt="Creations for Charity livestream event on Saturday"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@BeyondtheBrick"&gt;Beyond the Brick&lt;/a&gt; will once again be livestreaming for 12 hours in support of Creations for Charity, which raises money to donate LEGO sets to underprivileged children around the world, from midnight EST on Saturday, 28th November.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There&amp;#39;s also a chance to win a Godzilla set. Head over to &lt;a href="https://tiltify.com/@beyond-the-brick/lego-godzilla-charity-fundraiser"&gt;Tiltify &lt;/a&gt;to donate to the cause to enter the draw.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:45:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Forklift</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136585</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136585</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8835-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Forklift"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8835-1'&gt;8835&lt;/a&gt; Forklift, released during 1989. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Technic/year-1989'&gt;7 Technic sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8835-1'&gt;240 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 2,218 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8835-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8835-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $116.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8835-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136585/random-set-of-the-day-forklift"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Best modular building: Semi-final results</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136561</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136561</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135935_mbc.jpg' alt="Best modular building: Semi-final results"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over 6,000 votes were cast during the semi-final bouts in our quest to crown the best modular building.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The result of one of the clashes was very close, and we almost needed a recount: there were just 30 votes between them!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136561/best-modular-building-semi-final-results"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Holiday gift guide: over $200</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136280</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136280</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136284_hgg26.jpg' alt="Holiday gift guide: over $200"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the last of our holiday gift guides, we take our pick from sets costing more than $200, of which &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/query-12743"&gt;32 were released this year&lt;/a&gt;, which, surprisingly, is far fewer than in 2025. They are all excellent, though, and they will all be on someone&amp;#39;s wish list: they are, after all, the ultimate LEGO sets.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out what the Brickset team recommend after the break, then let us know which one you&amp;#39;d like to give, or receive, in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136280/holiday-gift-guide-over-200"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Fire Vulture</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136558</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136558</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/7703-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Fire Vulture"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/7703-1'&gt;7703&lt;/a&gt; Fire Vulture, released during 2006. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Exo-Force/year-2006'&gt;19 Exo-Force sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/7703-1'&gt;177 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-7703-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$15 / £9.99, which equates to about US$24 / £17 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 3,826 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=7703-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=7703-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $105.90,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=7703-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136558/random-set-of-the-day-fire-vulture"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO HBO Harry Potter sets revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136552</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136552</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136552_76481_Prod_Ow5VJT0mcHCB.jpg' alt="LEGO HBO Harry Potter sets revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The new HBO Harry Potter series is now only a few weeks away and four LEGO sets based on the series have been announced today.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Though relatively similar to the normal sets from the Warner Bros. movies, it is interesting to see some new versions of familiar scenes, such as &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76481-1/Privet-Drive"&gt;76481&lt;/a&gt; Privet Drive. These sets also revisit the Hogwarts Express, as well as Gryffindor Common Room.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sets will be released on January 1st and you can view them all below...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136552/lego-hbo-harry-potter-sets-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Marvel 67023 Marvel Rivals: Jeff the Land Shark official images!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136540</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136540</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/67023-1.jpg' alt="LEGO Marvel 67023 Marvel Rivals: Jeff the Land Shark official images!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jeff the Land Shark is an unusual Marvel character introduced to the comics in 2018, generally associated with Gwenpool and Kate Bishop.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now a LEGO rendition of Jeff has been unveiled for release on January 1st: &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/67023-1/Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark"&gt;67023&lt;/a&gt; Marvel Rivals: Jeff the Land Shark! Based on the landshark&amp;#39;s appearance in the Marvel Rivals game, the set contains 495 pieces and will cost &amp;pound;44.99, $49.99 or &amp;euro;49.99.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images below...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136540/lego-marvel-67023-marvel-rivals-jeff-the-land-shark-official-images!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Holiday gift guide: $100-$200</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136281</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136281</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136284_hgg26.jpg' alt="Holiday gift guide: $100-$200"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our penultimate holiday gift guide looks at sets in the $100-200 price range, of which &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/query-12740"&gt;76 were released this year&lt;/a&gt;, which is about 50% more than in 2025.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;#39;re looking for gifts at this price, you are spoilt for choice, with exceptional 18+ sets and top-of-the-range play sets for kids to choose from.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out what the Brickset team recommend after the break, then let us know what you would select in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136281/holiday-gift-guide-100-200"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: The Kwik-E-Mart</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136528</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136528</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/71016-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: The Kwik-E-Mart"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/71016-1'&gt;71016&lt;/a&gt; The Kwik-E-Mart, released during 2015. It was the only The Simpsons set released that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/71016-1'&gt;2179 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-71016-1'&gt;6 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$199.99 / £179.99, which equates to about US$266 / £243 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 10,521 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=71016-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=71016-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $602.80,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=71016-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136528/random-set-of-the-day-the-kwik-e-mart"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Competition reminder: Build a Restaurant of the World</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136507</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136507</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136507_carrot.jpg' alt="Competition reminder: Build a Restaurant of the World"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our building competition ends this time next week so if you&amp;#39;ve not already done so, get your entry in ASAP!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/subtheme-Restaurants-of-the-World/theme-Promotional"&gt;four Restaurants of the World&lt;/a&gt; that were offered as gifts with purchase during the year were great fun and well received. We want you to build one in the same style. Simple as that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Mr. Carrot&amp;#39;s Eatery by Anna Fryzowicz is a great example. We particularly like the NPU of the brick separator!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View the rules and find out how to enter after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136507/competition-reminder-build-a-restaurant-of-the-world"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Holiday gift guide: $50-$100</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136282</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136282</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136284_hgg26.jpg' alt="Holiday gift guide: $50-$100"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today&amp;#39;s holiday gift guide examines sets costing $50 to $100, in which an &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/query-12741"&gt;outstanding range of 127 sets&lt;/a&gt; have been released this year.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of &amp;#39;adults welcome&amp;#39; sets at this price that would make great gifts for those who might not (yet) be AFOLs, as well as many that will be appreciated by kids.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out what Brickset staff have picked after the break, then let us know what you would have chosen in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136282/holiday-gift-guide-50-100"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Andrea's Mountain Hut</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136501</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136501</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/41031-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Andrea's Mountain Hut"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/41031-1'&gt;41031&lt;/a&gt; Andrea's Mountain Hut, released during 2014. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Friends/year-2014'&gt;46 Friends sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/41031-1'&gt;119 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-41031-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$9.99 / £9.99, which equates to about US$14 / £14 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 2,234 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=41031-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=41031-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $14.30,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=41031-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136501/random-set-of-the-day-andrea-s-mountain-hut"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136498</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136498</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we've published recently:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='reviewlist'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75480-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136348'&gt;75480 Duel on Bespin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;75480 Duel on Bespin is pretty much faultless, with exceptional accuracy throughout&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40918-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136432'&gt;40918 Winter Snow Globe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;An attractive seasonal GWP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40914-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136400'&gt;40914 Retro Jukebox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;This colourful and attractive GWP is well worth placing a big order for&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75470-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136296'&gt;75470 Mustafar Duel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Apart from the lava collection droid and an expensive price, this is a superb set&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75478-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136126'&gt;75478 Rebel Y-wing Starfighter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Easily the best minifigure-scale Y-wing to date, this model is close to perfection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75459-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/132384'&gt;75459 Imperial Lambda-class Shuttle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;There is much to like about this Imperial Shuttle, but its proportions are simply not right&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review'&gt;View more reviews in the news archive »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 75480 Duel on Bespin</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136348</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136348</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136348_Bespin 1.jpg' alt="Review: 75480 Duel on Bespin"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75480-1/Duel-on-Bespin"&gt;75480&lt;/a&gt; Duel on Bespin takes inspiration from the famous lightsaber duel between Luke Skywalker and Darth Vader during The Empire Strikes Back, concluding with an iconic moment in the history of cinema. This scene definitely deserves a place in the 50th anniversary range.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Moreover, I think this rendition of the lightsaber duel looks excellent. There are similarities between this model and &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75294-1/Bespin-Duel"&gt;75294&lt;/a&gt; Bespin Duel, sold briefly in the US in 2020, but the new design includes more of the sensor balcony where the duel ends and generally seems more refined. It also offers a fantastic concept art minifigure: Darth Vader.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136348/review-75480-duel-on-bespin"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Holiday gift guide: $25-$50</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136283</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136283</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136284_hgg26.jpg' alt="Holiday gift guide: $25-$50"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;In today&amp;#39;s instalment of our holiday gift guide, we turn our attention to sets retailing between $25 and $50.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/query-12742"&gt;151 sets in the price range&lt;/a&gt;, including some of the lowest-priced Icon sets, and many awesome play sets perfect for gifting to kids.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out what we&amp;#39;ve selected after the break, then let us know your own picks in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136283/holiday-gift-guide-25-50"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:02:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136480</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136480</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we&amp;#39;ve posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;

