&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 154,698, which is 25,222 fewer than last week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Surveillance Scooter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136474</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136474</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/1954-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Surveillance Scooter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/1954-1'&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt; Surveillance Scooter, released during 1995. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Space/year-1995'&gt;6 Space sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/1954-1'&gt;23 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-1954-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,982 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=1954-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=1954-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $41.10,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=1954-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136474/random-set-of-the-day-surveillance-scooter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136471</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136471</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40918-1/Winter-Snow-Globe'&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4435&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40914-1/Retro-Jukebox'&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4183&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/5010880-1/Retro-Space-M-Tron'&gt;5010880&lt;/a&gt; Retro Space M-Tron&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3341&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/6671145-1/Inside-Santa-s-Workshop'&gt;6671145&lt;/a&gt; Inside Santa's Workshop&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2658&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2564&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/21372-1/La-Catrina'&gt;21372&lt;/a&gt; La Catrina&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1800&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75478-1/Rebel-Y-wing-Starfighter'&gt;75478&lt;/a&gt; Rebel Y-wing Starfighter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1782&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75480-1/Duel-on-Bespin'&gt;75480&lt;/a&gt; Duel on Bespin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1703&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75467-1/A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster'&gt;75467&lt;/a&gt; A New Hope Movie Poster&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1621&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75172-1/Y-wing-Starfighter'&gt;75172&lt;/a&gt; Y-wing Starfighter&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1608&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of set detail pages viewed this week is 1,904,697, which is 66,694 fewer than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Brickset Bouts: Best Modular Building Semi-Final 2</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136462</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136462</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136462_combined-image.jpg' alt="Brickset Bouts: Best Modular Building Semi-Final 2"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are close to crowning your favourite modular building, but there are still two bouts to go.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both the sets in today&amp;#39;s semi-final clash deserve their place in it, but only one can progress to the final.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today&amp;#39;s advocates are&lt;em&gt; M_Jibril &lt;/em&gt;who extols the virtues of &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1"&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner, while &lt;em&gt;Tereglith &lt;/em&gt;will persuade you to vote for &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10246-1"&gt;10246&lt;/a&gt; Detective&amp;#39;s Office.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Read their pitches after the break then cast your vote at the end.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136462/brickset-bouts-best-modular-building-semi-final-2"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Holiday gift guide: under $25</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136284</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136284</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136284_hgg-2026.jpg' alt="Holiday gift guide: under $25"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Friday and Christmas are fast approaching, so our annual Holiday Gift Guide has returned, helping you find the perfect LEGO gifts for friends and family. We have divided the entire product range into five separate categories, beginning with sets costing below $25.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There have been &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/query-12739"&gt;96 eligible items&lt;/a&gt; released during 2026 in that price bracket, which equates to about &amp;pound;22 and &amp;euro;25.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out what we&amp;#39;ve chosen after the break, then let us know what you&amp;#39;d choose to gift in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136284/holiday-gift-guide-under-25"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: Straight Track with Crossing</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136447</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136447</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/159-1.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: Straight Track with Crossing"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/159-1'&gt;159&lt;/a&gt; Straight Track with Crossing, released during 1976. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Trains/year-1976'&gt;8 Trains sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/159-1/rebrickable'&gt;25 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 414 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=159-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=159-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=159-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136447/vintage-set-of-the-week-straight-track-with-crossing"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Insiders Weekend has begun</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136439</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136439</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136340_insiders.jpg' alt="Insiders Weekend has begun"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insiders Weekend at &lt;a href="/click"&gt;LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; is underway in the Antipodes and most of Europe and will sweep around the world at the crack of midnight tonight. Here&amp;#39;s a reminder of what&amp;#39;s going on:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox free with purchases over &amp;pound;225/&amp;euro;250/$250&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe free with purchases over &amp;pound;155/&amp;euro;170/$170&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;New rewards in the Rewards Centre, including &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/5010880-1"&gt;6671142&lt;/a&gt; Retro M-Tron Explorer and a &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/6671145-1"&gt;6671145&lt;/a&gt; Inside Santa&amp;#39;s Workshop, both available for 2,400 points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Plus,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Double VIP points on all purchases&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Quadruple VIP points on around 40 sets including:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76354-1"&gt;76354&lt;/a&gt; S.H.I.E.L.D. Helicarrier&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21067-1"&gt;21067&lt;/a&gt; Tower Bridge&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21370-1"&gt;21370&lt;/a&gt; E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/72153-1"&gt;72153&lt;/a&gt; Venusaur, Charizard and Blastoise&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75409-1"&gt;75409&lt;/a&gt; Jango Fett&amp;#39;s Starship&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75419-1"&gt;75419&lt;/a&gt; Death Star&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10350-1"&gt;10350&lt;/a&gt; Tudor Corner&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reductions of c. 20% on a number of sets, including:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75367-1"&gt;75367&lt;/a&gt; Venator-class Republic Attack Cruiser&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21353-1"&gt;21353&lt;/a&gt; The Botanical Garden&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10341-1"&gt;10341&lt;/a&gt; NASA Artemis Space Launch System&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76300-1"&gt;76300&lt;/a&gt; Arkham Asylum&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, if you&amp;#39;re not already a Insider, if you sign up this weekend you&amp;#39;ll receive an extra10% discount.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Full details are available on the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?u=https://www.lego.com/en-gb/insiders-weekend-deals&amp;amp;r=insidersweekend"&gt;Insiders Weekend page at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/click?r=insidersweekend"&gt;Shop now &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Quick Look: 40918 Winter Snow Globe</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136432</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136432</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136432_P1015495.jpg' alt="Quick Look: 40918 Winter Snow Globe"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insiders weekend kicks off tomorrow and there are not one but two new gifts with purchase on offer, including &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe which is free with purchases exceeding &amp;pound;155/&amp;euro;170/$170.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136432/quick-look-40918-winter-snow-globe"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Ultra Stealth Raider</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136418</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136418</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/70595-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Ultra Stealth Raider"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/70595-1'&gt;70595&lt;/a&gt; Ultra Stealth Raider, released during 2016. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Ninjago/year-2016'&gt;37 Ninjago sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/70595-1'&gt;1093 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-70595-1'&gt;7 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$99.99 / £84.99, which equates to about US$133 / £115 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 2,807 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=70595-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=70595-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $434.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=70595-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136418/random-set-of-the-day-ultra-stealth-raider"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>BrickLink is unavailable again</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136413</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136413</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136413_BrickLink Downtime.jpg' alt="BrickLink is unavailable again"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;BrickLink was offline for a week earlier this month and has encountered another issue today, so the website has again been taken offline.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The disruption once again relates to &amp;#39;unusual activity&amp;#39; and BrickLink has been taken offline while its team investigates the issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The next community update will be issued by 18:00 UTC tomorrow, so hopefully we will have more information then. For now, there is &lt;a href="https://maintenance.bricklink.com/faq.html"&gt;an FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; on BrickLink, which may address some of your concerns.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, the independent LEGO marketplace &lt;a href="https://brickowl.com/?utm_source=brickset" rel="nofollow" title="Link to external website, opens in a new tab."&gt;BrickOwl&lt;/a&gt; remains online and ready to meet your ABS needs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; BrickLink has issued a further statement and apparently plans for the website to be back online by 18:00 UTC on Tuesday, November 24th.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Quick look: 40914 Retro Jukebox</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136400</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136400</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136400_P1015488.jpg' alt="Quick look: 40914 Retro Jukebox"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox is one of two exciting new gifts with purchase that will be available at &lt;a href="/click"&gt;LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; during the upcoming Insiders Weekend and the BFCM extravaganza next week.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;ll be free with purchases exceeding &amp;pound;225 / &amp;euro;250 / $250, which is a high threshold, but I predict that it&amp;#39;ll be one of the most sought-after GWPs of the year, likely to command in excess of &amp;pound;35/$50 on the secondary market.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136400/quick-look-40914-retro-jukebox"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Emma's Splash Pool</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136386</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136386</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/3931-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Emma's Splash Pool"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/3931-1'&gt;3931&lt;/a&gt; Emma's Splash Pool, released during 2012. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Friends/year-2012'&gt;36 Friends sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/3931-1'&gt;43 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-3931-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$5.99 / £4.99, which equates to about US$9 / £7 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 4,678 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=3931-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=3931-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $10.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=3931-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136386/random-set-of-the-day-emma-s-splash-pool"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2027 LEGO Speed Champions Formula 1 sets revealed, with driver minifigures!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136381</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136381</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136381_77267_Prod_EbJiOeRJmGQw.jpg' alt="2027 LEGO Speed Champions Formula 1 sets revealed, with driver minifigures!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of ten Speed Champions Formula 1 cars was released in 2025 and evidently proved very popular, as the full grid of eleven teams will be available from March 1st next year.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The cars themselves look excellent to me and incorporate some new elements to recreate the 2026 cars as faithfully as possible. However, I think the minifigures included will be of greater interest to many F1 fans, as these sets come with the actual drivers, rather than the generic minifigures seen in 2025!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View all eleven sets after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136381/2027-lego-speed-champions-formula-1-sets-revealed-with-driver-minifigures!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Best modular building: Semi final bout 1</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136361</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136361</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136361_sf1.jpg' alt="Best modular building: Semi final bout 1"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only four modular buildings remain in our competition to crown your favourite. In this first semi-final round, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10255-1"&gt;10255&lt;/a&gt; Assembly Square takes on &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10243-1"&gt;10243&lt;/a&gt; Parisian Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rad what &lt;em&gt;KotZ &lt;/em&gt;has to say about the restaurant and &lt;em&gt;Darth_Dee&lt;/em&gt; about the square after the break, then cast your vote.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136361/best-modular-building-semi-final-bout-1"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Skrall</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136359</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136359</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8978-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Skrall"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8978-1'&gt;8978&lt;/a&gt; Skrall, released during 2009. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Bionicle/year-2009'&gt;30 Bionicle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8978-1'&gt;50 pieces&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$12.99 / £8.79, which equates to about US$20 / £14 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 2,782 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8978-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8978-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $132.30,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8978-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136359/random-set-of-the-day-skrall"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 75470 Mustafar Duel</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136296</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136296</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136296_Mustafar 1B.jpg' alt="Review: 75470 Mustafar Duel"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The confrontation between Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker, now Darth Vader, on Mustafar has only appeared &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/tag-Duel-on-Mustafar"&gt;three times&lt;/a&gt; in the Star Wars range, before now. This is an important scene in the Star Wars series, so I am glad to see it return among the 50th anniversary sets.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75470-1/Mustafar-Duel"&gt;75470&lt;/a&gt; Mustafar Duel is not really what I expected for the next Mustafar set, which I hoped would encompass more of the lightsaber duel. What is included appears quite detailed though and the three minifigures are definitely desirable.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136296/review-75470-mustafar-duel"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Insiders Weekend: What to Expect</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136340</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136340</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136340_insiders.jpg' alt="Insiders Weekend: What to Expect"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;As has become customary, the weekend before Thanksgiving is Insiders Weekend at &lt;a href="/click"&gt;LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt;, which gives LEGO Insiders the opportunity to avail themselves with GWPs and offers before they are available to everyone else during the Black Friday event the weekend after.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;#39;s what to expect on the 21st and 22nd of November:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Double VIP points on all sets&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Quadruple VIP points on selected sets&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Savings on selected sets&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox free with purchases over &amp;pound;225/&amp;euro;250/$250&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe free with purchases over &amp;pound;155/&amp;euro;170/$170&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;New rewards in the Rewards Centre, including &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/5010880-1"&gt;6671142&lt;/a&gt; Retro M-Tron Explorer and a &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/sets/6671145-1'&gt;6671145&lt;/a&gt; Inside Santa's Workshop, both available for 2,400 points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Full details are available on the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/click/?u=https://www.lego.com/en-gb/insiders-weekend-deals&amp;amp;r=insidersweekend"&gt;Insiders Weekend page at LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt;. We&amp;#39;ll update the article once we know what&amp;#39;s included in the 4x points and discounts.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136340/insiders-weekend-what-to-expect"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Airjitzu Battle Grounds</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136334</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136334</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/70590-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Airjitzu Battle Grounds"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/70590-1'&gt;70590&lt;/a&gt; Airjitzu Battle Grounds, released during 2016. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Ninjago/year-2016'&gt;37 Ninjago sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/70590-1'&gt;666 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-70590-1'&gt;5 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$59.99 / £49.99, which equates to about US$82 / £69 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,008 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=70590-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=70590-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $493.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=70590-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136334/random-set-of-the-day-airjitzu-battle-grounds"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Insiders Weekend gifts-with-purchase revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136311</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136311</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40914-1.jpg' alt="LEGO Insiders Weekend gifts-with-purchase revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two upcoming gift-with-purchase sets have been revealed, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1/Retro-Jukebox"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox and &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1/Winter-Snow-Globe"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These sets will be available from November 21st, over the LEGO Insiders Weekend. &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40914-1/Retro-Jukebox"&gt;40914&lt;/a&gt; Retro Jukebox will need a &amp;pound;225, $250 or &amp;euro;250 spend, while spending &amp;pound;155, $170 or &amp;euro;170 will qualify for &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40918-1/Winter-Snow-Globe"&gt;40918&lt;/a&gt; Winter Snow Globe.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both sets will almost certainly be available over the Black Friday weekend too, as usual.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View both sets after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136311/lego-insiders-weekend-gifts-with-purchase-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO House 10th anniversary: what's in the box?</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136305</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136305</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136305_P1015441.jpg' alt="LEGO House 10th anniversary: what's in the box?"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Next year marks the 10th anniversary of the opening of the LEGO House in Billund and, to help raise awareness, LEGO sent mystery boxes to &amp;#39;influencers&amp;#39; a couple of weeks ago.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Inside was a nice surprise that we&amp;#39;ll be giving away to two lucky Brickset visitors in due course.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136305/lego-house-10th-anniversary-what-s-in-the-box"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:50:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Cosmic Laser Launcher</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136303</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136303</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/6953-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Cosmic Laser Launcher"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/6953-1'&gt;6953&lt;/a&gt; Cosmic Laser Launcher, released during 1987. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Space/year-1987'&gt;17 Space sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/6953-1'&gt;208 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-6953-1'&gt;3 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$30, which equates to about US$86 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,668 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=6953-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=6953-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $686.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=6953-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136303/random-set-of-the-day-cosmic-laser-launcher"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136301</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136301</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we've published recently:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='reviewlist'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75478-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/136126'&gt;75478 Rebel Y-wing Starfighter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Easily the best minifigure-scale Y-wing to date, this model is close to perfection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75459-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/132384'&gt;75459 Imperial Lambda-class Shuttle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;There is much to like about this Imperial Shuttle, but its proportions are simply not right&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/72161-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/133777'&gt;72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Discover a rare Pokémon behind a clever little game&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75642-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135711'&gt;75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;There is little included for such a high price, but the minifigures in particular are superb&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40874-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135696'&gt;40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A well-built Santa and chimney diorama, with a somewhat pointless countdown feature.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/42705-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135584'&gt;42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A larger autumnal scene with fun moving functions &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review'&gt;View more reviews in the news archive »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 75478 Rebel Y-wing Starfighter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136126</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136126</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136126_Y-wing 1.jpg' alt="Review: 75478 Rebel Y-wing Starfighter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The classic BTL-A4 Y-wing Starfighter has been available multiple times in the LEGO Star Wars range, although not for a decade at minifigure-scale, since &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75172-1/Y-wing-Starfighter"&gt;75172&lt;/a&gt; Y-wing Starfighter arrived in early 2017. We are certainly due for an updated rendition of the Rebel fighter-bomber.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75478-1/Rebel-Y-wing-Starfighter"&gt;75478&lt;/a&gt; Rebel Y-wing Starfighter obliges and the model looks amazing, not least because of its new dual-moulded canopy, finally replacing the element from 1999. The engines also appear much-improved in relation to earlier Y-wings, so I am approaching this set with a great deal of optimism.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136126/review-75478-rebel-y-wing-starfighter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>